# Copy to .env.local for local overrides. Build-time only, and everything here ends up in the
# public JS bundle: NEVER put the admin token or any secret in a VITE_* variable.
#
# Base URL of the Distillery API, no trailing slash, e.g. https://api.example.com
# Empty (default) = same origin: the Vite dev server proxies /api to localhost:8000, and the
# Docker image serves the frontend and the API from one origin.
# Leave empty in production: the API image serves the frontend, so calls are same-origin.
VITE_API_BASE=
